      "properties": {
        "h3_fixed_fps": true
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "UPDATE 9 — EXACT AV BRIDGE\n\nUse constant 24 fps source videos. Source and output FPS are fixed at 24.\n\nH3 AV Bridge Timing validates target_frames = 5 + 17*k and preserve_frames = 39 + 51*k (39, 90, 141, 192, ...). The target must exceed twice the preserved context. 56 is not a valid AV context.\n\nDefault 192/39: 1.625 s protected at each end; 4.75 s generated middle. H3 Assemble Bridge Audio trims both protected audio spans on the 40 Hz grid and conforms the middle to the exact picture timeline, including targets that end between audio ticks."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "BRIDGE TIMING\n\nThe three values above are the shared timing controls: target H3 frames, preserved frames per side, and FPS. They drive the H3 target length, bridge preservation, visual overlap, output FPS, and generated-audio trim.\n\nThe audio trim is calculated on H3's 40 Hz latent grid so it removes exactly the protected audio head/tail from the decoded bridge. Defaults 192 / 39 / 24 evaluate to 1.625 s trim start and 4.75 s generated middle.\n\nUse exact H3 video runs (5, 22, 39, 56, ...). Values such as 39 and 192 also land exactly on shared 24-fps / 40-Hz AV boundaries."
      },
      "color": "#234",
      "bgcolor": "#345"
    },
